# Dredge with several draws: "if you're instructed to draw two cards and you replace the first draw with a dredge ability,
# another card with a dredge ability (including one that was milled by the first dredge ability) may be used to replace the
# second draw" (its ruling; CR 121.2, 702.52a). Ancestral Recall's first draw is replaced by Golgari Grave-Troll's dredge 6,
# which mills Stinkweed Imp; the second by the Imp's dredge 5; the third finds no card with dredge in Bot1's graveyard and is
# drawn. Bot1 ends with both dredgers and one Forest drawn, eleven cards milled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Sapphire
Thoughtseize
Ancestral Recall
Golgari Grave-Troll
Plains
Plains
Forest
Stinkweed Imp
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thoughtseize.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Choose(Golgari Grave-Troll)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ancestral Recall.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Accept
? Bot1.Graveyard.Stinkweed Imp.Power = 1
Bot1.Accept
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

